# GitHub workspace token for authorized Scout repository operations in the Local VM.
# Fine-grained, org-owned, selected to house-of-434-site. Loaded ONLY by the
# `app` service (compose env_file). Copy to .env.workspace (gitignored) and
# fill in. Never put it in .env.secrets (that file is shared by services that
# must not hold it).
RELAY_GITHUB_WORKSPACE_TOKEN=
